		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Pink, fleshy mound of clawed arms and womanly breasts. No head or legs, center of the mass is a great fanged slit. Feed on overindulgence.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 44, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +7 (1d8 + swallow), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Swallow</strong>. On a natural attack roll of 18-20, target is swallowed. Each turn, CHA 15+ or develop a phobia. Regurgitates all swallowed if dealt at least 10 damage in one round to the inside of its gullet.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
